        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Any malignant growth or tumor caused by abnormal and uncontrolled cell division; it may spread to other parts of the body through the lymphatic system or the blood stream.</rdfs:comment>
